# Project TITAN V1.2 — Smart Access Platform

**Architecture Lock — UI 변경 ❌**

## Identity

V1.2 = QMS + Paper + Smart + QR + NFC Ready + MES Ready — **현장 중심 통합 업무 플랫폼**

## Philosophy

- Paper Workflow **유지** · Smart Workflow **추가**
- 사용자: Paper **OR** Smart 선택
- Smart Access: QR/NFC → 업무 화면 직행 (메뉴 탐색 ❌)

## Version Roadmap

```text
V1.0 QMS → V1.1 Paper+Workflow → V1.2 QR Smart Access → V2.0 NFC → V3.0 MES
```

