## Smart Access ID (Mandatory)

**Canonical:** `NDK://` — QR · NFC · Barcode 공통

| ID | Screen |
|----|--------|
| `NDK://INCOMING` | 입고등록 |
| `NDK://OUTGOING` | 출고등록 |
| `NDK://INSPECTION` | 검사등록 |
| `NDK://CERTIFICATE` | 성적서 |
| `NDK://EQ/{code}` | 설비/생산 |

Legacy: `NDK|EQ|{code}` — backward compat in `equipmentQr.js`

## Equipment QR Rules

- ❌ per product · ❌ per LOT
- ✅ **one QR per equipment** (ION-01, GAS-01, …)
- ✅ multi-copy print for multiple locations

## QR Print Center (Future)

- Menu: **QR 출력센터** (`/environment/qr`)
- Features: PDF · 재출력 · 미리보기 · 인쇄
- Label spec: `QR_LABEL_SPEC` — A6/A7 · 무광 · 설비명/번호/공정 + NFC reserved area

## NFC Ready

QR and NFC call **same Smart Access ID** — no app change when adding NFC tags

## Mobile (Future)

Dedicated screens — NOT shrunk PC · big buttons · ≤3 clicks · field-work only

## Smart Access Dashboard (Future)

HOME — **금일** QR usage stats (입고/생산/검사/출고 회수)

## Implementation Rules

1. Register new Smart targets in `SMART_ACCESS_ID_REGISTRY` + `SMART_ACCESS_TARGETS` first
2. Use `parseSmartAccessId()` / `buildSmartAccessPath()` — no ad-hoc URLs
3. Paper prints (HTL/OUT/INV/DPR) — **never remove**
4. Workflow state — `titanWorkflowStatus.js` only
5. UI — approved screens + query/deep link only until PM approves mobile

## Do Not

- Change approved UI for V1.2 architecture work
- Delete Paper workflow or prints
- Create per-product or per-LOT QR
- Use `오늘` in user-facing text — use `금일`
